        "liquid_qB6CcD": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ============================================================\n  PS WATCHES — Bloc Titre + Prix + Tag + 4 USPs (inspiré smooche)\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n  ⚠️ IMPORTANT : avant de coller ce bloc, masque les blocs\n  natifs \"Title\" et \"Price\" de ta section \"Product information\"\n  (cliquer l'œil pour les rendre invisibles) — sinon le titre\n  et le prix seront affichés en doublon.\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n  Tous les styles sont en !important pour échapper aux règles\n  du thème qui forçaient des hauteurs/paddings sur les boxes.\n  Le markup utilise <div>/<div> au lieu de <ul>/<li> pour la\n  même raison.\n  ============================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ps-product-head,\n  .ps-product-head * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head {\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Titre ===== */\n  .ps-product-head__title {\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 30px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    line-height: 1.15 !important;\n    color: #171717 !important;\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Ligne prix + tag ===== */\n  .ps-product-head__price-row {\n    display: flex !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__price-compare,\n  .ps-product-head__price-current {\n    font-size: 18px !important;\n    line-height: 1 !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__price-compare {\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    color: #BF0505 !important;\n    text-decoration: line-through !important;\n    text-decoration-color: #BF0505 !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__price-current {\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    color: #000 !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__tag {\n    display: inline-flex !important;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 4px 9px !important;\n    background-color: #56C4AE !important;\n    color: #fff !important;\n    font-size: 11px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    border-radius: 3px !important;\n    line-height: 1 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Grille 4 USPs — DIV au lieu de UL/LI + reset agressif ===== */\n  .ps-product-head__usps {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr) !important;\n    grid-auto-rows: max-content !important;\n    gap: 6px !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    list-style: none !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__usp {\n    /* Box compacte avec hauteur strictement déterminée par le contenu */\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    align-self: start !important;\n    justify-self: stretch !important;\n    gap: 6px !important;\n    padding: 5px 10px !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    background-color: #F4EBE5 !important;\n    border-radius: 6px !important;\n    border: 0 !important;\n    min-width: 0 !important;\n    min-height: 0 !important;\n    height: auto !important;\n    max-height: none !important;\n    aspect-ratio: auto !important;\n    list-style: none !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__usp-icon {\n    flex: 0 0 18px !important;\n    width: 18px !important;\n    height: 18px !important;\n    display: block !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    color: #2D2D2D !important;\n  }\n  .ps-product-head__usp-text {\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 11px !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n    color: #2D2D2D !important;\n    /* Permet au texte de wrapper sur 2 lignes si nécessaire (comme smooche) */\n    white-space: normal !important;\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    text-overflow: clip !important;\n    word-break: normal !important;\n    min-width: 0 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Mobile : 2 colonnes maintenu, padding plus généreux (feel premium smooche) */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .ps-product-head__title { font-size: 22px !important; }\n    .ps-product-head__price-compare,\n    .ps-product-head__price-current { font-size: 16px !important; }\n    .ps-product-head__usps { gap: 8px !important; }\n    .ps-product-head__usp {\n      padding: 8px 12px !important;\n      gap: 9px !important;\n      border-radius: 8px !important;\n    }\n    .ps-product-head__usp-icon {\n      flex: 0 0 18px !important;\n      width: 18px !important;\n      height: 18px !important;\n    }\n    .ps-product-head__usp-text {\n      font-size: 12px !important;\n      font-weight: 600 !important;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ps-product-head\">\n\n  {%- comment -%} ===== Titre ===== {%- endcomment -%}\n  <h1 class=\"ps-product-head__title\">{{ product.title }}</h1>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ===== Ligne prix + tag ===== {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"ps-product-head__price-row\">\n    {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}\n      <span class=\"ps-product-head__price-compare\">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>\n    {%- endif -%}\n    <span class=\"ps-product-head__price-current\">{{ product.price | money }}</span>\n    <span class=\"ps-product-head__tag\">Offre de juin</span>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ===== 4 USPs avec SVG inline minimalistes ===== {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"ps-product-head__usps\">\n\n    {%- comment -%} 1. Assemblé à la main → icône main (Lucide-style) {%- endcomment -%}\n    <div class=\"ps-product-head__usp\">\n      <svg class=\"ps-product-head__usp-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M18 11V6a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M14 10V4a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v6\"/>\n        <path d=\"M10 10.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v8\"/>\n        <path d=\"M18 8a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v6a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-2c-2.8 0-4.5-.86-5.99-2.34l-3.6-3.6a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.82L7 15\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ps-product-head__usp-text\">Assemblé à la main</span>\n    </div>\n\n    {%- comment -%} 2. Une équipe française → drapeau France en couleur {%- endcomment -%}\n    <div class=\"ps-product-head__usp\">\n      <svg class=\"ps-product-head__usp-icon ps-product-head__usp-icon--flag\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <g>\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"4\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#0055A4\" rx=\"1\"/>\n          <rect x=\"8\" y=\"4\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n          <rect x=\"16\" y=\"4\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#EF4135\" rx=\"1\"/>\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"4\" width=\"24\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E5E5E5\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" rx=\"1\"/>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ps-product-head__usp-text\">Une équipe française</span>\n    </div>\n\n    {%- comment -%} 3. Garantie 100% satisfait → bouclier coché {%- endcomment -%}\n    <div class=\"ps-product-head__usp\">\n      <svg class=\"ps-product-head__usp-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/>\n        <polyline points=\"9 12 11 14 15 10\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ps-product-head__usp-text\">Garantie 100% satisfait</span>\n    </div>\n\n    {%- comment -%} 4. Mouvement automatique → écrou hexagonal {%- endcomment -%}\n    <div class=\"ps-product-head__usp\">\n      <svg class=\"ps-product-head__usp-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <polygon points=\"12,2.5 21,7.5 21,16.5 12,21.5 3,16.5 3,7.5\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ps-product-head__usp-text\">Mouvement automatique</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>"
          }
