            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ============================================================\n  PS WATCHES — Bloc 2 perks au-dessus de \"Ajouter au panier\"\n  (Inspiré des 2 cases smooche \"Buy 1 Get 1 FREE\" + \"Mystery Gift\")\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n  Box 1 : Garantie 3 ans offerte\n          + sous-titre \"Prise en charge par nos ateliers français\"\n  Box 2 : Un écrin en cuir offert (sans sous-titre)\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n  À coller dans la section \"Product information\" via\n  Add Block → Custom Liquid, placé juste au-dessus du\n  bouton \"Ajouter au panier\".\n  ============================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ps-perks,\n  .ps-perks * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  .ps-perks {\n    display: flex !important;\n    flex-direction: column !important;\n    gap: 6px !important;\n    margin: 12px 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    list-style: none !important;\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .ps-perks__header {\n    text-align: center !important;\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 500 !important;\n    font-style: normal !important;\n    color: #4a4a4a !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em !important;\n    margin: 0 0 4px !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    line-height: 1.2 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ps-perks__box {\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    align-self: stretch !important;\n    gap: 12px !important;\n    padding: 8px 12px !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    background-color: #F4EBE5 !important;\n    border-radius: 8px !important;\n    border: 0 !important;\n    min-width: 0 !important;\n    min-height: 0 !important;\n    height: auto !important;\n    max-height: none !important;\n    aspect-ratio: auto !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n    list-style: none !important;\n  }\n\n  .ps-perks__icon {\n    flex: 0 0 36px !important;\n    width: 36px !important;\n    height: 36px !important;\n    display: block !important;\n    object-fit: contain !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ps-perks__text {\n    flex: 1 1 auto !important;\n    min-width: 0 !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    flex-direction: column !important;\n    gap: 2px !important;\n  }\n\n  .ps-perks__title {\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    font-weight: 500 !important;\n    line-height: 1.25 !important;\n    color: #171717 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ps-perks__sub {\n    font-family: \"Red Hat Display\", sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 12px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n    color: #6B6B6B !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .ps-perks__icon { flex: 0 0 32px !important; width: 32px !important; height: 32px !important; }\n    .ps-perks__title { font-size: 13px !important; }\n    .ps-perks__sub { font-size: 11.5px !important; }\n    .ps-perks__box { padding: 7px 10px !important; gap: 10px !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ps-perks\">\n\n  {%- comment -%} ===== Header (équivalent du \"Flash SALE\" smooche) ===== {%- endcomment -%}\n  <p class=\"ps-perks__header\">Inclus avec votre commande</p>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ===== Box 1 : Garantie 3 ans + sous-titre ===== {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"ps-perks__box\">\n    <img class=\"ps-perks__icon\"\n         src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0787/4818/9014/files/Garantie.png?v=1780139769\"\n         alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"ps-perks__text\">\n      <span class=\"ps-perks__title\">Garantie 3 ans offerte</span>\n      <span class=\"ps-perks__sub\">Prise en charge par nos ateliers français</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ===== Box 2 : Écrin en cuir (sans sous-titre) ===== {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"ps-perks__box\">\n    <img class=\"ps-perks__icon\"\n         src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0787/4818/9014/files/Ecrin_box.png?v=1780139770\"\n         alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"ps-perks__text\">\n      <span class=\"ps-perks__title\">Un écrin en cuir offert</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>"
